FILE: assets/css/marquee.css
FEATURE: marquee-module
DATE: 2026-10-11
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'message-box-module' (uncommitted at the time)

REASON
NEW FILE. Base styles for the container (.vMarquee: relative, overflow hidden), the track
(.vMarqueeTrack: nowrap flex row, max-content width) and the items (no shrink, no wrap), so
one set always measures the same. The module also sets the structural ones inline, because
this sheet arrives after the first measurement.

OLD_SECTION
(none, new file)

NEW_SECTION
.vMarquee { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.vMarqueeTrack { display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; width: max-content; align-items: center; }
.vMarqueeTrack > * { flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; }
